        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >《飘渺西游》<strong>——</strong>回归经典<strong>，</strong>重温最初的感动<strong>！</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >官方QQ交流1群：155063045</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >官方QQ交流2群：718465813</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >飘渺西游是由无端科技开发的Q版大型多人在线回合制网游，玩家可以扮演大唐、地府、盘丝、龙宫、方寸、普陀等角色，体验独特的门派技能和特色。游戏特色包括结婚系统、人物属性系统、师门系统、宠物系统和装备系统等，提供了多种角色成长路径和社交互动。玩家在游戏中可以通过各种任务和副本挑战提升角色实力。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >飘渺西游经典六大门派</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839550/extras/251d4a4baf917d649c9ab7a2ddcfc1e2.avif?t=1773914570\" width=800 height=415 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >新门派“云梦阁”</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839550/extras/d42b202b56cb35ebdafdf8ee944bc96a.avif?t=1773914570\" width=800 height=560 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >新宠物“龙神公主”</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839550/extras/8f731adc7e71062418c4a19c7affbe01.avif?t=1773914570\" width=760 height=480 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >新飞行器带你畅游经典场景“东海湾”</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839550/extras/90cad6466655b5b2cdc9e697a830466c.avif?t=1773914570\" width=800 height=464 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >新副本“无底洞”，感受地涌夫人的爱恨情仇。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839550/extras/b78fccec8b6f3c6155df89b5b124bee5.avif?t=1773914570\" width=800 height=800 /></span></p>",
